  "#about": "Turret hulls, declared to the engine through ship_data_add_extra. Shipped in the sbs_utils media pack. Load-bearing: a behav_station object fires its beams ONLY when its hull was declared by an add-on (engine-measured 1.3.5). Strict JSON, not YAML: the engine parses ship data as HJSON. Keep the final newline. Every entry is complete on purpose. Beam stats are fixed at the hull: a variant needs a new entry, and its beam range must match turret_make(range=). roles is 'turret', not 'station', so turrets do not inherit docking, market or protect-the-station objectives.",
